    about_p1:'I’m Rodrigo, <strong style="color:var(--t1)">a product designer specialized in applied AI and process automation</strong>. I design, build and deploy <strong style="color:var(--t1)">AI agents</strong> (Botpress, Vapi, Claude/GPT/Gemini), <strong style="color:var(--t1)">hyperautomation flows</strong> (Make, n8n) and digital product with AI integrated into the flow — not as an add-on.',
