    cc_t1:'★ Main project · 2026',cc_t2:'React · TypeScript · GSAP · Framer Motion · Gamification',cc_h:'Capsule Corp — My CV turned into a Saiyan power-up',cc_d:'What if a CV were played instead of read? Six Saiyan transformations synced to real stages of my career, seven hidden dragon balls, Recruiter Mode and a background that evolves as you scroll. No cardboard accessibility: WCAG 2.2 AA verified with axe-core, and 100 in accessibility, best practices and SEO in Lighthouse.',cc_m:'6 transformations · 7 dragon balls · Recruiter Mode · WCAG 2.2 AA · db.rodrigonegrete.es',cc_web:'Open the site ↗',rd_t1:'★ Open source · 2026',rd_t2:'Open source · 287 resources · 7 languages · React · WebGL · 3D',rd_m:'6 categories · 7 languages · Live preview · Framer Motion · Three.js · Vercel',pdp_t:'🎵 Music game · React · Supabase · AI',pdp_m:'Multiplayer · Real time · play.dedicalo.es',je_t1:'Team TFM · EBIS Master',je_h:'Just Enjoy — AI agents that plan your trip end to end',je_d:'Team thesis (TFM) of the EBIS Master: a planner that turns your preferences into a complete itinerary — flights, hotel, activities, map and PDF — with AI agents and real data. My part: frontend, UX/UI design and interfaces, and part of the n8n automation.',je_m:'27 n8n nodes · Supabase · Firebase · SerpAPI · Tavily',ib_t1:'Business case · EBIS Master',ib_t2:'CoE · RAG · Automation',ib_h:'Iberdata — AI & Automation Office',ib_d:'Business case for a 450-employee company: Center of Excellence, governance, architecture, two pilots, sprints, KPIs and risks.',ib_m:'n8n · Supabase · OpenAI API · Playwright · 12 weeks',zb_t1:'AI prototype',zb_h:'ZODI BTO — Conversational oracle',zb_d:'ZODI\'s first prototype: a query terminal with Botpress, mystic personality, contextual memory and an honest tone before scaling to the current PWA product.',zb_m:'Botpress · WordPress · AI character',p1_tag:'Founder · AI · Wedding Tech',p1_m:'Sole founder · Suno · React · Make',lab_ai_h:'AIbueno.es — AI and Web Development Agency',lab_p1:'AI Agents',lab_p2:'Web Development',lab_p3:'Mobile Apps',lab_t3:'Minimalist · Ink Network',lab_t4:'Agency · AI Lead Gen',lab_t7:'Personal brand ·',lab_t8:'Portfolio · Living system',lab_exp:'Explore →',
