    p11_h:'Rodd.es — 287 web resources you try live, not just read about',p11_d:'Open directory in 7 native languages (ES · EN · CA · FR · IT · DE · PT) with effects, animations, React components, microinteractions, animated backgrounds and 3D scenes ready to preview live, edit and copy the code.',
    ep_h:'Events Planner — The operating system for wedding planners who work without signal',ep_d:'Three people coordinate up to 12 weddings a year, on their feet, in venues with no signal: Wedding + Events needed tools that work offline. I designed and built a web app to plan weddings between the team and the couples: home dashboard, a workspace per wedding, guests and seating plan, suppliers and corners, budget, printable contract, a private portal for each couple and dossiers. It works on mobile, tablet and desktop, installs as an app and opens offline.',ep_m:'Dashboard · Couple portal · Seating · Suppliers · Contract · Budget · Offline PWA · Supabase · aem.rodd.es',ep_t1:'★ Own product · 2026 · In production',ep_t2:'Product design · Offline PWA · Visual system · End-to-end development',kb_h:'KETTELBRO — A new kettlebell session every day, with the science in plain sight',kb_d:'A pocket coach for people who train with one or two kettlebells, chalky hands and the phone metres away. I designed a PWA that serves a 10 to 25 minute session each day, guides it set by set with huge numbers and cites the study behind every block, limits included. Full case: context, proto-personas, decisions with the rejected alternative, a night-time visual system, accessibility and stack.',kb_m:'Daily session · Live companion · Evidence A–D · Offline PWA · Next.js · Firebase',kb_t1:'★ Own product · 2026',kb_t2:'UX/UI · PWA · Visual system · Next.js · Firebase',pf_h:'This portfolio — Every animation is a decision',pf_d:'A visual portfolio risks turning motion into decoration. I document every animation, theme, sound and interaction on this site: the problem it solves, what I researched, what I rejected and what it costs. With mini-demos you can try, mobile Lighthouse from 64 to 96-98 and the mistakes I found along the way.',pf_m:'9 motion pieces · 6 demos · 5 themes · Astro + React · Lighthouse 96-98',pf_t1:'★ Own project · 2026',pf_t2:'Motion · Research · Performance · Accessibility',
